      "sourceTextSha256": "62a9639f0ecf175e7c50085e03c980144b52a6d7423c71f7e816d833e6e08587",
      "text": "5 February · Arrival at Rio de Janeiro Airport, where an English-speaking guide greets you with a sign bearing your names, and transfer to the Belmond Copacabana Palace, Deluxe Ocean View room. Free evening, with dinner at Cipriani, the hotel’s celebrated Italian restaurant. Optional (not included): VIP fast-track service on arrival, with escort from the aircraft door, electric cart, priority security lane, help with formalities and baggage, and porter service.",
